# No em dashes

Never use the em dash (`—`) or en dash (`–`) in user-facing copy, blog posts, summaries, comments, commit messages, or chat replies.

Use a comma, period, colon, parentheses, or a normal hyphen (`-`) instead.

```text
❌ BAD: Filters vs facets — visible controls
✅ GOOD: Filters vs facets: visible controls
✅ GOOD: Filters vs facets (visible controls)
✅ GOOD: Filters vs facets, with visible controls
```
